OL,3,GNEWSAChanges agreed to new A&E hospital
OL,4,Abuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanges have been agreed to a #100m
OL,7,Fproject to upgrade a hospital's
OL,8,Femergency department and critical care
OL,9,Funit.
OL,11,FWork on the scheme at Dorset County
OL,12,FHospital started last year with the
OL,13,Fbuilding expected to open in 2027.
OL,15,FA topping out ceremony was held in July
OL,16,Fafter the installation of the rooftop
OL,17,Fhelipad, marking the structure reaching
OL,18,Fits highest point.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
