OL,3,GNEWSAChanges agreed to new A&E hospital
OL,4,Abuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Council has now approved
OL,7,Frevisions to the original masterplans,
OL,8,Fmainly affecting the link corridor
OL,9,Fjoining the new building to the
OL,10,Fexisting emergency department, rooftop
OL,11,Fducting, and landscaping beside the
OL,12,Fpatient car park.
